cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "calrcpsp: calendar-aware resource-constrained project scheduling"
abstract: >-
  A Python library for project scheduling under work-calendar constraints.
  It reads the published CA-RCPSP benchmark format, builds max-plus
  scheduling matrices, and returns start times, makespan, task slack, the
  critical path and calendar compliance. It also repairs a schedule after a
  disruption. Shifts, breaks and holidays are handled exactly through a
  cumulative work-time function and its inverse.
